        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: avatar.service.js and product-photo.service.js. Avatar retains only current fingerprint/version/present and removes body on delete; it is not an archive of all versions. Product photos use Product.detailsVersion and retained digests; unreferenced product blobs are deleted transactionally. Neither branch proves historical media bytes survive removal." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="20" y="1621" width="1100" height="145" />
